{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cb01ce807527022f2f88fb2eb4bd97008d6918848c7c54c85fbf5a424b30f141", "ja": "（名古屋城でのライブを翌日に控え、準備は万端！\n今日は環と、名古屋観光することになった）", "zh": "（明天就是名古屋城的演唱会，准备工作万无一失！今天要和环一起游览名古屋）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "e7be5aae1fcc0cb54c317b1e21d009562d005e5a5e178fb217e97d8a0ee7d73d", "ja": "おやぶん、おやぶん！　お城の中って入れるんだよね？\nたまき、上までのぼってみたいぞ！", "zh": "大将，大将！城里面可以进去的吧？\n环想爬到最上面看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1002_p", "source_sha256": "27ab44ddb0c67cdbe2df49da4c5ac3b3d98acbe244d75364ce3eb6e9bf7b016d", "ja": "ああ、いいぞ。せっかく来たんだ。\nこの機会に見学してみよう。", "zh": "嗯，可以啊。难得来一趟，\n就趁这个机会参观一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "dd3d21821d1be13b0ec614315761a5d8553701d29cc07c0a170acc338f7f55c1", "ja": "やった～！　これでたまきも\nえらい武将っぽくなれるかな？", "zh": "太好啦～！这样环也能\n变得像个厉害的武将了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "53036b437884b674740f96dc5d99f50400b974889b9cf7bb6ff02fb1cfe19356", "ja": "今回のたまき、なおまさの格好で\nライブやることになったんでしょ？", "zh": "这次环要穿着直政的装扮去开演唱会了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "7dc17245953ff77998a91c65aa239a7d6ceb127bcfd5c3302bda67136c4b1c3b", "ja": "だから、いっぱい勉強してきたんだー！\n武将って、てんしゅかく？にいるんだよね。", "zh": "所以，环也认真学习了很多哦——！\n武将是在天守阁里的，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1006_p", "source_sha256": "02e9c973bd1603b60153c8558268aa50f5c9581c3df46a1bd1416fec53f71af5", "ja": "ああ、井伊直政のことだな。そうだよ。\nそんなに熱心になってくれていたとは……。", "zh": "啊，是指井伊直政啊。没错。\n没想到你竟然这么认真……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "98259bd677729692231525b4d1470c369c9d7aee3943d1a97eae82b89a00e263", "ja": "うんっ！　だって、なおまさは強くてカッコイイし。\nそれに、赤い鎧を着てるんだよ！", "zh": "嗯！因为直政又强又帅气。\n而且，他还穿着红色铠甲呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "f39f3c8441f65b09ca3a3280f75d2f0caaf77ec9764adc06f24bf09559002901", "ja": "戦隊ヒーローのレッドみたい！\nたまきも、なおまさみたいになりたいぞ！", "zh": "就像战队英雄里的红队员一样！  \n环也想变得像直政那样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fe66adecdd9a0d5e7f7183599e28a2141aee2c3b78987bcd6eb02bbc451dc0bf", "ja": "なるほど、レッドか。環らしい表現だな。", "zh": "原来如此，是红色战队英雄啊。还真是符合环的表达。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1010_p", "source_sha256": "827e195a319ad0daaa3b62cc1ef75caaee6470540588c25dff8ceab644f0df0d", "ja": "確かに、明日の衣装は、井伊直政の甲冑がモデルに\nなってるからな。きっと気に入ると思うよ。", "zh": "确实，明天的服装是以井伊直政的铠甲为原型设计的。我觉得你一定会喜欢的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "62ba83fca00ce8c6970f8c10cf8d54bb515d4fc94ecbf8507d91b058b63bd11b", "ja": "くふふ♪　楽しみ～！\n……あ、ねえねえ、おやぶん！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 好期待呀～！\n……啊，对了对了，老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "69562b437c30b504882c9330a48d2080cad81815bb17d7f44fb474aff4dada9c", "ja": "なおまさになれるってことは……\nたまきもカッコイイ刀、持てたりする？", "zh": "也就是说，能成为真正的武士……环境也能拿上帅气的刀吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5abfedc33a8c63374682dbade13b901b787cfda42d2c470672ddcf0008281ad9", "ja": "刀か……いや、環はアイドルだからな。\n手に持つなら、刀よりマイクだ！", "zh": "刀啊……不对，环可是偶像。\n要拿在手里的话，比起刀，还是麦克风更合适！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "626291bc66d2e3f26d1ae6b76a11d002b99fcc95a44f4d756f6a8ae87f0e2c60", "ja": "あ、そっか……わかったよ、おやぶん！　くふふ♪\nたまき、ライブでみんなを驚かせちゃうぞ～！", "zh": "啊，原来如此……明白了，老大！嘿嘿♪\n小环要在演唱会上让大家大吃一惊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a5b328b0ef7767c48a86c95520eaac13e4d72ecd859dfecb71a9b099abd23d91", "ja": "ああ、その意気だ！　明日は\n環の歌とパフォーマンスで圧倒してくれ。", "zh": "啊，就是这个劲头！明天就用环的歌声和表演把大家彻底震撼住吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0243_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "1ebedc09160ddb434655b92ceaacbb3dae0a2c85b960a606ba526b2d04fbdd7a", "ja": "うん！　たまき、ワクワクしてきた！\nそしたら、早くお城に行こう！　城攻めだぞ～！", "zh": "嗯！环环开始兴奋起来了！\n那我们快点去城堡吧！要攻城啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
